            "characterId": "ec21035f-a4fe-4bb6-b877-eb871a5ec2cf",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3024",
            "content": {
                "en": "......",
                "zh": "......",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1139.0,
            "positionY": 112.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "27a690b0-c8d7-48a0-a6ba-8f1c5176abab",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "ec21035f-a4fe-4bb6-b877-eb871a5ec2cf",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3025",
            "content": {
                "en": "I knew it… no wonder you stayed in there so long… (muttering)",
                "zh": "我就说......怎么在里头待了那么久......（嘟囔）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1487.0,
            "positionY": 118.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "3bc563f4-2f04-497a-bdac-a177d0772604",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "ec21035f-a4fe-4bb6-b877-eb871a5ec2cf",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4098",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "最近芸台市里不太平呀，总有奇怪的家伙到处闹事。你没事就好。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1837.0,
            "positionY": 121.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "ff0137fe-ee5d-41f6-a1ad-7e48a1a28e1c",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "9bf1f67d-ba62-4b57-a9cc-3ce252972f0f",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4099",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "大爷，你知道沈梦之在哪里吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2181.0,
            "positionY": 123.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "6667a91a-c69b-4457-91dd-9a25bc798162",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "ec21035f-a4fe-4bb6-b877-eb871a5ec2cf",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4100",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "前面那个戏台，沈梦之应该就在那里。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2526.0,
            "positionY": 129.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b23be4f2-8ffa-4456-8a08-8f9355d7fde9",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "ec21035f-a4fe-4bb6-b877-eb871a5ec2cf",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4101",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "我劝你，最好小心小心些。小沈这孩子，心思深，身上的担子也重。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2879.0,
            "positionY": 137.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "c4d52f27-202d-43d7-9d98-8bcdbb2c7811",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4096",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "......",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3223.0,
            "positionY": 139.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b41b921a-c246-4cee-9eae-94ee9ae083fe",
            "index": 12,
            "characterId": "ec21035f-a4fe-4bb6-b877-eb871a5ec2cf",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3033",
            "content": {
                "en": "She’s so young to already be a priestess... and Xi Mu’s blessing isn’t always a blessing. Sigh...",
                "zh": "这么年轻就当上了祭司，喜母的加护也不总是件好事，唉......",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4464.0,
            "positionY": 325.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "e3707f17-c8f2-4bfe-8138-930555e15b29",
            "index": 13,
            "characterId": "3d251560-306a-4584-8903-bebe74011bfc",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3034",
            "content": {
                "en": "What do you mean by that? Is Noema in danger?",
                "zh": "您这话是什么意思？梦之她会有危险吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4812.0,
            "positionY": 330.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "693849c2-d46e-426f-bc5f-5c7dc30dda82",
            "index": 14,
            "characterId": "ec21035f-a4fe-4bb6-b877-eb871a5ec2cf",
