            "characterId": "ec21035f-a4fe-4bb6-b877-eb871a5ec2cf",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3032",
            "content": {
                "en": "Mm… then you’d better be careful. That kid… she’s got a lot on her mind, and a heavy burden on her shoulders.",
                "zh": "嗯......那可得小心些了。小沈这孩子，心思深，身上的担子也重。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4101.0,
